    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that collective stuff sounds a bit more stable for a real government. the individual rights thing always seems to lead to chaos and people only looking out for themselves. do you think a society actually functions better when it leans toward that kind of total communal unity instead of everyone just doing whatever they want?",
